<title>SPAIN: Spain key money rate unchanged at 6.25 percent.</title>
<headline>Spain key money rate unchanged at 6.25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said it left its key money rate unchanged at 6.25 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 4.035 trillion pesetas against an equal amount bid.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
